+---
+id: task-002-add-equipment-availability-query
+type: task
+title: "Add equipment availability query"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `availability(query)` to the in-memory rental service. The query has `start`, `end`, and an
+optional `kind`; it returns sorted equipment IDs that match the requested kind (or all kinds) and
+have no overlapping booking for the complete half-open period.
